om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note bridge/shlib/dep.om: the gate's dependency library (dep.tsv), whose exports imp.om imports: a doubling, a
note result with a dirty upper half (imported as int), a subtraction (imported with its arguments swapped) and a
note read through a pointer (imported with the pointer moved by 8 bytes).
export fn omega_dep_twice a ulong to ulong
ret mul a 2
end
export fn omega_dep_dirty to ulong
ret ulong 16045690981097406469
end
export fn omega_dep_sub a ulong b ulong to ulong
ret sub a b
end
export fn omega_dep_rd c view uint 1 to uint
ret get c 0
end
